s to contribute to emergency relief efforts and provide practical assistance during challenging times. This emergency effort builds on VT Markets' sustained community outreach in Thailand. The company recently supported the Baan Imjai shelter, providing essential supplies, furniture, and vocational setup donations for urban safety nets, as well as partnering with the Baan Nokkamin Foundation to supply food and educational materials for vulnerable children. These ongoing community donations complement VT Markets' flagship CSR program, Finance Forward, which promotes long-term financial literacy and independence across emerging markets. By pairing emergency response with long-term educational and social welfare support, VT Markets continues to strengthen its commitment to local communities across Southeast Asia. About VT Markets VT Markets is a regulated multi-asset broker with a presence in over 160 countries as of today. It has earned numerous international accolades including Best Gold Trading Platform, Best Online Trading and Fastest Growing Broker. In line with its mission to make trading accessible to all, VT Markets offers comprehensive access to over 1,000 financial instruments and clients benefit from a seamless trading experience via its award-winning mobile application. For more information, please visit the official VT Markets website or email us at info@vtmarkets.com. Alternatively, follow VT Markets on Facebook, Instagram, or LinkedIn. For media enquiries and sponsorship opportunities, please email media@vtmarkets.com", "content": "ONLY AVAILABLE IN PAID PLANS", "keywords": ["fin", "ecm", "fnt", "csr"], "creator": ["cision pr newswire"], "language": "english", "country": ["yemen", "philippines", "singapore", "timor-leste", "pakistan", "bhutan", "armenia", "turkey", "afghanistan", "india", "saudi arabia", "vietnam", "romania", "azerbaijan", "united arab emirates", "hong kong", "turkmenistan", "brunei", "bangladesh", "laos", "tajikistan", "qatar", "taiwan"